TOOL_TABLE	|idris2 |`idris2` |not a mise tool: install pack (https://github.com/stefan-hoeck/idris2-pack#installation), then `pack install-app idris2`\n|zig |`zig` |https://ziglang.org/download/ or Guix `zig`\n|(recipes) |`just`, `shellcheck` |your OS package manager, e.g. `dnf install just ShellCheck`
SYSTEM_DEPS_SECTION	=== System packages for Idris2\n\nIdris2 is built by pack on top of Chez Scheme and GMP, which come from your OS:\n\n* Fedora: `sudo dnf install chez-scheme gmp-devel`\n* Debian/Ubuntu: `sudo apt install chezscheme libgmp-dev`\n* macOS: `brew install chezscheme gmp`\n\nThe Guix development shell (`build/manifest.scm`) already includes both.
